cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or these result tables, please cite the paper below."
title: "surface-code-decoder-priors"
abstract: >-
  Simulation code, experiment runners, seeded run manifests, analysis scripts and
  result tables for a study of when fitting a matching decoder's prior from
  syndrome data helps and when it hurts, with a script that recomputes every
  number quoted in the accompanying paper from the archived tables.
type: software
license: Apache-2.0
